# This tenant's own id, used only so LoginForm can pass `tenantId` to POST /auth/login and
# GET /auth/providers — required for a DedicatedDb-strategy tenant (this app's own tenant is
# one, see apps/jira-server/.env.example), whose `users` table isn't reachable by the
# global-by-email fallback POST /auth/login otherwise falls back to. Same value as
# apps/jira-server/.env's JIRA_TENANT_ID — kept as a separate var here since this is a
# different process/build (Vite only exposes vars prefixed VITE_ to client code).
VITE_JIRA_TENANT_ID=
